    ".statement-layout": "\n  <div class=\"story-hero reveal\">\n    <p class=\"story-overline\">BUILDING SRI LANKA’S NEXT GENERATION OF TECHNOLOGY</p>\n    <h2 class=\"display-title\">Intelligence<br><em>made here.</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"story-signal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><i></i><b></b></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"story-opening reveal\">\n    <p class=\"story-lead\">At DeepIQ, we believe the future belongs to organisations that embrace intelligence, innovation and technology today.</p>\n    <p>DeepIQ is a technology company focused on AI-driven products, intelligent infrastructure and next-generation digital solutions, with a clear ambition to help position Sri Lanka at the forefront of the rapidly evolving technology landscape.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"story-vision reveal\">\n    <span>OUR VISION</span>\n    <p>Bring world-class technology to Sri Lanka, create local innovation, and build solutions that are ready for the future.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"story-partnerships reveal\">\n    <div class=\"story-partner-label\"><span>GLOBAL EXPERTISE</span><i></i><span>LOCAL IMPACT</span></div>\n    <p>To accelerate this journey, DeepIQ has partnered with globally established technology brands such as <strong>Cloudmon</strong> and <strong>MiPhi</strong>, bringing proven expertise in AI-powered observability, enterprise infrastructure and advanced storage technologies to the Sri Lankan market.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"story-turn reveal\">\n    <p>But we are not stopping at bringing global technology to Sri Lanka.</p>\n    <h3>We are building<br><em>our own.</em></h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"story-build-grid\">\n    <article class=\"story-build-card reveal\">\n      <span>01 / DEEPIQ PRODUCTS</span>\n      <h3>AI-powered.<br>Real-world ready.</h3>\n      <p>DeepIQ is developing a portfolio of AI-powered products and solutions, designed to address real-world business challenges and create new opportunities across industries.</p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"story-build-card story-first-card reveal\">\n      <div class=\"story-first-orbit\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><b></b></div>\n      <span>02 / A SRI LANKAN FIRST</span>\n      <strong>01</strong>\n      <h3>AI-enabled<br>laptops</h3>\n      <p>DeepIQ became the first company to introduce AI-enabled laptops designed for the next generation of computing.</p>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"story-pillars reveal\" aria-label=\"DeepIQ's strategic pillars\">\n    <span><b>01</b>Global Technology</span><i></i>\n    <span><b>02</b>Local Innovation</span><i></i>\n    <span><b>03</b>A Smarter Future</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"story-future reveal\">\n    <p class=\"story-overline\">GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY. LOCAL INNOVATION. A SMARTER FUTURE.</p>\n    <div>\n      <h3>Helping lead Sri Lanka’s<br><em>AI transformation.</em></h3>\n      <p>Our ambition is to become a leading force in Sri Lanka's AI transformation—connecting global innovation with local talent, developing our own intellectual capabilities and helping organisations move confidently into the next generation of technology.</p>\n    </div>\n    <blockquote>“We don't want to simply follow the technology revolution. <strong>We want to help lead it.</strong>”</blockquote>\n  </div>"
